":"AIR_CONDITIONED_VEHICLE","typeDescription":"In-vehicle air conditioning","description":"Air-conditioned vehicle"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Guide"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"The best of Z\u00fcrich views"}],"exclusions":[{"category":"FOOD_AND_DRINK","categoryDescription":"Food and drink","type":"LUNCH","typeDescription":"Lunch","description":"Lunch"}],"additionalInfo":[{"type":"STROLLER_ACCESSIBLE","description":"Infants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller"},{"type":"PETS_WELCOME","description":"Service animals allowed"},{"type":"PUBLIC_TRANSPORTATION_NEARBY","description":"Public transportation options are available nearby"},{"type":"INFANT_SEATS_AVAILABLE","description":"Specialized infant seats are available"},{"type":"PHYSICAL_EASY","description":"Suitable for all physical fitness levels"}],"cancellationPolicy":{"type":"STANDARD","description":"For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours before the scheduled departure time.","cancelIfBadWeather":false,"cancelIfInsufficientTravelers":false,"refundEligibility":[{"dayRangeMin":1,"percentageRefundable":100},{"dayRangeMin":0,"dayRangeMax":1,"percentageRefundable":0}]},"bookingConfirmationSettings":{"bookingCutoffType":"FIXED_TIME","bookingCutoffInMinutes":1440,"confirmationType":"INSTANT","bookingCutoffFixedTime":"00:00:00"},"bookingRequirements":{"minTravelersPerBooking":1,"maxTravelersPerBooking":7,"requiresAdultForBooking":true},"languageGuides":[{"type":"GUIDE","language":"de","legacyGuide":"de/SERVICE_GUIDE"},{"type":"GUIDE","language":"en","legacyGuide":"en/SERVICE_GUIDE"},{"type":"GUIDE","language":"es","legacyGuide":"es/SERVICE_GUIDE"}],"bookingQuestions":["PICKUP_POINT","SPECIAL_REQUIREMENTS","TRANSFER_AIR_ARRIVAL_AIRLINE","TRANSFER_AIR_ARRIVAL_FLIGHT_NO","TRANSFER_ARRIVAL_DROP_OFF","TRANSFER_ARRIVAL_MODE","TRANSFER_ARRIVAL_TIME"],"tags":[20205,367661,11930,21736,367658,11889,21911,20757,22083,11941,12075,11929],"destinations":[{"ref":"577","primary":true}],"itinerary":{"itineraryType":"STANDARD","skipTheLine":false,"privateTour":true,"duration":{"variableDurationFromMinutes":240,"variableDurationToMinutes":360},"itineraryItems":[{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMZneRzk8aRvZkBhRy3ZR/I="}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Our expert guide, fluent in your chosen language, will take you on a journey through Zurich's enchanting Old Town. You\u2019ll visit its renowned churches, such as the Grossm\u00fcnster, Fraum\u00fcnster, the mystical Wasserkirche, and the impressive St. Peter's, delving into the city's fascinating history."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyBJHS7hJbPAwUU+rS4Lx2sY="}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Zurich Main Station (Z\u00fcrich Hauptbahnhof) is a bustling hub of activity and a must-visit for anyone traveling to the city. As one of the largest railway stations in Europe, it offers a seamless blend of modern amenities and historic architecture. The station features a wide array of shops, cafes, and restaurants, making it a perfect spot to grab a bite or do some shopping before your journey. With excellent connections to local and international trains, trams, and buses, Zurich Main Station is not only a transportation hub but also a vibrant meeting point for locals and tourists alike. Don't miss the impressive main hall and the beautiful clock tower that add to the station's charm!"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyCHvSfxINYZ+UtMeX9crSVA="},"attractionId":16944},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"This Old Town district is thought to be where Zurich began as a Roman fort in the second century. For years, its hilltop location played an important role in defending and governing the city. Today, its main square is a popular spot for visitors and locals alike, known for its open-air chess boards, leafy avenues, and panoramic city views."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyPkTopdL4BwwXXv9SIN3QzY="},"attractionId":11044},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":60},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"YES","description":"With its striking 19th-century buildings and winding cobblestone lanes stretching along both sides of River Limmat, Zurich\u2019s Old Town (Altstadt) is the most atmospheric part of the city and home to many principal tourist attractions."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyGxfhdFk8LF/GD1P/PV46vs="},"attractionId":877},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"This prominent 13th-century Gothic cathedral is perhaps best known for one of its more recent additions"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-RaYlfRSLaIsd0SlazqDQkwoeNTZ//n799bds20YaDIFihk6p/II8kxtJmtFCw3WvlYaKeyH3HC1a8C1/ZCxQxScXnaGBEY9KPK3M8IgwxXk25SRbkN5KuHi5VtM6n9xDxCuJ/9H8AuyJDTqRwziQmsIdHTP87saMpfLS1hGTbYodUz0HF3NmunxX1DAX25Vt"}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"One of the most expensive strips of retail space in Europe, Zurich\u2019s Bahnhofstrasse is known for its many luxury shops selling designer fashion, jewelry, perfume, chocolate, and, of course, watches. While many visitors only go to window shop, the street is one of the city\u2019s main commercial areas, frequented by both locals and travelers"},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyP/uKJYtgR6lS57+82mmBHA="},"attractionId":883},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":30},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"YES","description":"Next, embark on an enchanting 25-minute cruise on the beautiful Lake Zurich. Get ready to be mesmerized by the picturesque scenery and breathtaking landscapes that are sure to leave you spellbound. This delightful journey offers a unique chance to immerse yourself in the region's natural beauty, with the tranquil waters of Lake Zurich providing a perfect backdrop to the city's captivating charm."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyCp7Fbi4y9dQeuzkxyXS++E="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":120},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"YES","description":"The \"Home of Chocolate Lindt\" offers a truly enchanting journey into the world of Swiss chocolate. As you step inside, you're immediately surrounded by the irresistible aroma of chocolate. Your adventure begins with a fascinating introduction to Lindt's rich history, celebrated for its production of premium chocolates in Switzerland and across Europe. \n\nThe highlight of your visit is the chance to indulge in a variety of Lindt chocolates, delighting your taste buds with exquisite creations. Additionally, you\u2019ll discover the raw ingredients that form the foundation of chocolate, such as cocoa. But the experience doesn\u2019t end there. \n\nYou\u2019ll have the opportunity to shop for exceptional chocolates and witness the true origins of chocolate. The Lindt store features an exclusive selection of fine chocolates, perfect to take home as a delightful reminder of this unforgettable experience."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-o0AXGEKPN4wJ9sIG0RAn5Pi6msXkHlQp13NOyTa9oJpqsMzyXAK4W3AN6ktXIfgM"}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"The home of Swiss banking at the heart of Zurich\u2019s luxury shopping street, Paradeplatz is one of the most powerful financial centers in Europe. The former 17th-century pig market is now a major transit interchange and home to the headquarters of UBS and Credit Suisse, as well as the flagship Confiserie Spr\u00fcngli chocolate store"}]},"productOption